### Логин (setup)
GET http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/session
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### Создание юзера (с ролью доктор)
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "Petr",
  "password": "!11IvanovII",
  "systemId": "petya",
  "person": {
    "names": [
      {
        "givenName": "Minimal",
        "familyName": "User"
      }
    ],
    "gender": "O"
  },
  "roles": [
    {
      "uuid": "4ef1f0f9-fee6-414b-910d-28e17df345c2"
    }
  ]
}

### 1.  Поиск Person по имени -> 200
GET http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person?q=John
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 4.  Поиск Person по UUID -> 200
GET http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 5.  Создание минимального Person (только имена + gender) -> 201
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

{
  "names": [
    {
      "givenName": "Test",
      "familyName": "Person",
      "preferred": true
    }
  ],
  "gender": "O"
}

### 6.  Создание Person с birthdate, estimated age, addresses, attributes -> 201
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

{
  "names": [{"givenName": "Ivan", "middleName": "Petrovich", "familyName": "Ivanov", "preferred": true}],
  "gender": "M",
  "birthdate": "1985-03-15",
  "birthdateEstimated": false,
  "dead": false,
  "addresses": [{
    "address1": "Hauptstr. 12",
    "cityVillage": "München",
    "stateProvince": "Bayern",
    "country": "Germany",
    "postalCode": "80331",
    "preferred": true
  }],
  "attributes": [{
    "attributeType": "uuid-of-Telephone-attribute-type",
    "value": "+49123456789"
  }]
}

### 7.  Создание Person Negative: создание без gender -> 400
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

{
  "names": [
    {
      "givenName": "Test",
      "familyName": "Person"
    }
  ]
}

### 7.  Создание Person Negative: создание без хотя бы одного имени -> 400
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 8.  Создание Person Negative: создание с одинаковым именем -> 400
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json


### 9.  Создание Person Negative: некорректный gender (не M/F/O) -> 400
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 10.  Создание Person Negative: birthdate в будущем -> 400
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 11.  Обновление gender, birthdate, dead=true + deathDate -> 200
PUT http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 12.  Обновление частичное, только birthdate -> 200
PUT http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 13.  Удаление полное, из БД (если на основе person создан пациент, нельзя удалить) -> 204
DELETE http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}?purge=true
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 14.  Удаление частичное (пометка об удалении, но из БД не удаляется) -> 200 или 204
DELETE http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 15.  Добавление дополнительного имени (non-preferred) -> 200
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}/name
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 16.  Добавление адреса (address1, cityVillage, country и т.д.) -> 201
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}/address
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 17.  Добавление кастомного атрибута (например, "Telephone number") -> 201
POST http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}/attribute
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json

### 18. Список всех атрибутов Person -> 200
GET http://localhost/openmrs/ws/rest/v1/person/{uuid}/attribute
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46QWRtaW4xMjM=
Accept: application/json